{
  "name": "InOut AI - 03 UAE Phone Normalization",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Uae Phone Normalization\n\nNormalizes UAE mobile and landline phone inputs into canonical UAE international format.\n\nInput: Phone-like value from phone, from, senderPhone, normalizedMessage.from, or customer_phone.\nOutput: { status: \"VALID|INVALID|UNSUPPORTED_COUNTRY|INCOMPLETE|UNSUPPORTED_UAE_FORMAT\", normalizedPhone: \"971500000000|97120000000\", phoneType: \"mobile|landline|unknown\" }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- Remove spaces, punctuation, plus signs, and separators.\n- Support safe UAE mobile formats such as 0500000000, +971500000000, 00971500000000, 971500000000, 050 000 0000, and 050-000-0000.\n- Support safe UAE landline formats such as 020000000, +97120000000, and 97120000000 so non-mobile WhatsApp sender data does not stop the router.\n- Return INVALID, UNSUPPORTED_COUNTRY, or INCOMPLETE without revealing customer records."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "clean-phone-characters",
      "name": "Clean Phone Characters",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -380,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const originalPhone = String($json.phone || $json.from || $json.senderPhone || $json.customer_phone || $json.normalizedMessage?.from || '').trim();\nconst digits = originalPhone.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\nconst correlationId = $json.correlationId || $json.normalizedMessage?.correlationId || 'corr_' + Date.now() + '_' + ($execution.id || 'n8n');\nreturn [{ json: { ...$json, originalPhone, phoneDigits: digits, correlationId, workflowExecutionId: String($execution.id || '') } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "convert-uae-format",
      "name": "Convert UAE Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -120,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "let digits = String($json.phoneDigits || '');\nif (digits.startsWith('00')) digits = digits.slice(2);\nlet normalizedPhone = '';\nlet phoneType = 'unknown';\nlet status = 'INVALID';\nif (!digits) status = 'INVALID';\nelse if (/^9715\\d{8}$/.test(digits)) { normalizedPhone = digits; phoneType = 'mobile'; status = 'VALID'; }\nelse if (/^05\\d{8}$/.test(digits)) { normalizedPhone = '971' + digits.slice(1); phoneType = 'mobile'; status = 'VALID'; }\nelse if (/^5\\d{8}$/.test(digits)) { normalizedPhone = '971' + digits; phoneType = 'mobile'; status = 'VALID'; }\nelse if (/^971[234679]\\d{7}$/.test(digits)) { normalizedPhone = digits; phoneType = 'landline'; status = 'VALID'; }\nelse if (/^0[234679]\\d{7}$/.test(digits)) { normalizedPhone = '971' + digits.slice(1); phoneType = 'landline'; status = 'VALID'; }\nelse if (/^[234679]\\d{7}$/.test(digits)) { normalizedPhone = '971' + digits; phoneType = 'landline'; status = 'VALID'; }\nelse if (digits.length > 0 && digits.length < 8) status = 'INCOMPLETE';\nelse if (digits.startsWith('971') || digits.startsWith('0')) status = 'UNSUPPORTED_UAE_FORMAT';\nelse status = 'UNSUPPORTED_COUNTRY';\nreturn [{ json: { ...$json, normalizedPhone, phoneType, phoneStatus: status } }];"
      }
    },
    {
